1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,397
Ever walked into a room and forgot why?

2
00:00:02,447 --> 00:00:03,859
Congratulations.

3
00:00:03,909 --> 00:00:06,178
You're Specimen 001.

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,005
The culprit has been hiding in plain sight.

5
00:00:09,055 --> 00:00:10,246
In every home.

6
00:00:10,296 --> 00:00:11,223
Maybe...

7
00:00:11,723 --> 00:00:13,016
right behind you.

8
00:00:13,333 --> 00:00:14,341
Observe.

9
00:00:14,391 --> 00:00:16,406
It stares at the fridge like the fridge

10
00:00:16,406 --> 00:00:17,459
owes it money.

11
00:00:17,509 --> 00:00:19,011
It checks its pockets.

12
00:00:19,061 --> 00:00:20,620
It consults the ceiling.

13
00:00:20,933 --> 00:00:21,952
The culprit?

14
00:00:22,002 --> 00:00:22,890
The door.

15
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:27,191
In 2011, psychologists at Notre Dame had people

16
00:00:27,191 --> 00:00:29,961
carry objects from one table to another.

17
00:00:30,011 --> 00:00:31,593
Some walked through a doorway.

18
00:00:31,643 --> 00:00:34,064
Some walked the same distance in one room.

19
00:00:34,367 --> 00:00:36,117
The doorway group forgot more.

20
00:00:36,433 --> 00:00:38,491
To the brain, a doorway marks the end

21
00:00:38,491 --> 00:00:39,520
of a chapter.

22
00:00:39,570 --> 00:00:41,404
Old scene: filed away.

23
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:44,878
Scientists call it the doorway effect.

24
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:46,625
And the strange part?

25
00:00:46,675 --> 00:00:49,138
Walking back into the first room didn't help.

26
00:00:49,467 --> 00:00:51,895
It even happened with doors on a computer

27
00:00:51,895 --> 00:00:52,392
screen.

28
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:55,065
So try this: say it out loud before

29
00:00:55,065 --> 00:00:55,739
you go.

30
00:00:55,789 --> 00:00:56,629
Keys.

31
00:00:56,679 --> 00:00:57,518
Keys.

32
00:00:57,568 --> 00:00:58,408
Keys.

33
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:00,560
Broken?

34
00:01:00,810 --> 00:01:01,559
No.

35
00:01:01,809 --> 00:01:04,266
Your brain is just closing one chapter to

36
00:01:04,266 --> 00:01:05,845
make room for the next...

37
00:01:06,167 --> 00:01:08,291
even if the next chapter is the fridge.

38
00:01:08,291 --> 00:01:09,080
Again.

39
00:01:09,080 --> 00:01:10,363
Perfectly human.
